msgid "当前系统架构与接入重构"
msgstr "Current system architecture and integration refactor"

msgid "Nexus 是静态装配的 C11 通用嵌入式平台。当前生产入口是 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`；[精确支持](support.md)区分八个料号、七个器件视图、 四个 F407 Board、软件参考和实际验证。产品任务、队列、私有 PCB、Flash 分区与 恢复策略由外部工程拥有。Native 是显式测试支撑；未选厂商依赖保留但不进入默认闭包。"
msgstr "Nexus is a statically assembled C11 embedded platform for reusable mechanisms. The production entry is `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`; [exact support](support.md) distinguishes eight parts, seven device views, four F407 Boards, software references and actual verification. External projects own product tasks, queues, private PCBs, Flash partitions and recovery policy. Native is explicit test support; unselected vendor dependencies remain retained outside the default closure."

msgid "本页先说明现有运行合同，再说明接入重构目标与任务。目标不代表实现已经完成。 本批以 [`ba13686`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/ba13686b91c94d19ef11acf910653ee2fcc9aa8b) 为源码基线；前序软件交付见 [PR #63](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/63)。 每项新结果必须绑定实际源码和配置，不能继承基线的测试或 SDK 资格。"
msgstr "This page first describes existing runtime contracts, then the integration refactor target and tasks. A target does not mean implementation is complete. This batch starts from [`ba13686`](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/tree/ba13686b91c94d19ef11acf910653ee2fcc9aa8b); [PR #63](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/63) records the preceding software delivery. Every new result must identify its actual source and configuration; baseline test or SDK qualification is not inherited."

msgid "![FIG-01：平台职责与外部产品边界](../assets/diagrams/platform-architecture.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-01: platform responsibilities and external product boundaries](../assets/diagrams/platform-architecture.svg)"

msgid "FIG-01：平台职责与外部产品边界"
msgstr "FIG-01: platform responsibilities and external product boundaries"

msgid "图表示当前职责、编译依赖与接口访问，边的含义以标签为准。可选 OS 和组件不在 每次 I/O 的强制路径中；静态结构不表示启动顺序或物理验收。"
msgstr "The diagram shows current responsibilities, build dependencies and interface access; labels define each edge. Optional OS and components are not mandatory on every I/O path. Static structure does not specify startup order or physical acceptance."

