msgid "显式后端的等待、通知、任务、队列和存储合同"
msgstr "Wait, notification, task, queue and storage contracts for explicit backends"

msgid "`components/`"
msgstr "`components/`"

msgid "通过公共端口复用的协议、器件和 owner 机制"
msgstr "Protocols, devices and owner mechanisms reused through public ports"

msgid "`tools/configure/`"
msgstr "`tools/configure/`"

msgid "用户意图、事实校验、不可变 IR 与静态连接生成"
msgstr "Authored intent, fact validation, immutable IR and static connection generation"

msgid "`cmake/`"
msgstr "`cmake/`"

msgid "唯一源码目标图、工具链和 Source SDK 消费"
msgstr "The sole source target graph, toolchains and Source SDK consumption"

msgid "`tests/support/native/`"
msgstr "`tests/support/native/`"

msgid "显式 host-test 模型与装配，不是生产 SoC"
msgstr "Explicit host-test models and assemblies, not a production SoC"

msgid "外部产品"
msgstr "External product"

msgid "main、scheduler、执行者、预算、区域与恢复策略"
msgstr "Main, scheduler, executors, budgets, regions and recovery policy"

msgid "Core 不依赖 Arch、SoC、OS 或厂商 SDK；Arch 不依赖 OS 或外设实现。I/O 依赖 Core，具体 provider 依赖公共 I/O、Core、Arch 和私有 SDK。组件通过窄端口访问 设备，所选 OS 后端保留自身真实内核与对象布局。源码入口见 [源码定位](../explanation/source-map.md)。"
msgstr "Core does not depend on Arch, SoC, OS or vendor SDKs; Arch does not depend on OS or peripheral implementations. I/O depends on Core; concrete providers depend on public I/O, Core, Arch and private SDKs. Components access devices through narrow ports, and selected OS backends retain their real kernel and object layouts. The [source map](../explanation/source-map.md) links source entries."

msgid "factory 返回已有静态 face，不初始化硬件。产品取得接口以后，经公共操作与共享 只读 `ops(context, ...)` 进入 provider。Platform 负责装配和生命周期，不转发每次 I/O；普通同步实例不承担异步 request、stream、队列或 OS 状态。"
msgstr "The factory returns existing static faces without initializing hardware. After obtaining an interface, a product reaches its provider through public operations and shared read-only `ops(context, ...)`. Platform owns assembly and lifecycle rather than forwarding each I/O. Ordinary synchronous instances do not carry asynchronous requests, streams, queues or OS state."

msgid "对象、所有权与设计原则"
msgstr "Objects, ownership and design principles"

msgid "对象"
msgstr "Object"

msgid "边界"
msgstr "Boundary"

msgid "controller"
msgstr "controller"

msgid "一个物理控制器行为域只有一个 live owner"
msgstr "One physical controller behavior domain has one live owner"

msgid "mode"
msgstr "mode"

msgid "决定实现、能力、状态和缓冲需求"
msgstr "Determines implementation, capabilities, state and buffer requirements"

msgid "face"
msgstr "face"

msgid "公共接口及实例 context，不替代 controller owner"
msgstr "Public interface and instance context; does not replace the controller owner"

msgid "endpoint"
msgstr "endpoint"

msgid "依赖控制器的逻辑或外部端点，不重复取得控制器"
msgstr "A logical or external endpoint depending on a controller, without acquiring it again"

msgid "signal"
msgstr "signal"

msgid "授权单 pin 与逻辑极性，不新增硬件 owner"
msgstr "Authorized single pin and logical polarity, without another hardware owner"

msgid "request／buffer"
msgstr "request/buffer"

msgid "接受后被借用，实际结清前保持有效"
msgstr "Borrowed after acceptance and kept valid until actual settlement"

msgid "receipt"
msgstr "receipt"

msgid "由具体 owner 记录实际剩余副作用"
msgstr "Records actual remaining effects at the concrete owner"

msgid "role／region"
msgstr "role/region"

msgid "显式资源用途与访问授权，不隐含固定 timer 或地址"
msgstr "Explicit resource purpose and access authority, without an implicit fixed timer or address"

msgid "单一职责体现在事实、决策、C 行为和源码图分别维护；开闭原则体现在同 IP 扩展 数据、新 IP 扩展实现、新公共语义扩展合同。可替换实现保持单位、错误、借用和完成 一致；接口按真实消费者划分。Adapter 隔离 HAL／LL，静态 factory 提供类别约束， 组件使用显式注入。SOLID 不要求设备基类、运行时注册或统一内核对象。"
msgstr "Single responsibility separates facts, decisions, C behavior and the source graph. The open/closed principle means extending data for the same IP, implementation for new IP and contracts for new public semantics. Substitutable implementations preserve units, errors, borrowing and completion; interfaces follow real consumers. Adapters isolate HAL/LL, the static factory constrains categories, and components use explicit injection. SOLID does not require a device base class, runtime registration or a universal kernel object."

msgid "当前构建与目标接入链路"
msgstr "Current build and target integration chain"

msgid "![FIG-03：当前配置与原子生成](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg)"
msgstr "![FIG-03: current configuration and atomic generation](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg)"

msgid "FIG-03：当前配置与原子生成"
msgstr "FIG-03: current configuration and atomic generation"

msgid "图表示当前构建期输入和产物流，不表示运行期调用。现有 schema-2 TOML、只读 SoC／Board 事实、不可变 typed IR、原子 bundle 和 CMake 唯一目标图继续保留。 生产默认路径由声明式 package、通用 DataProvider、DomainPolicies、私有 `constants` 与有限 StaticRecipe 组成；旧 F4 家族 Python 构造模块已删除，不保留家族导入注册表。 事实与静态连接按同一快照解析，协议见[接入指南](../guides/provider-porting.md)。 字段权威、具体模式和消费者仍须本批集成验收；删除旧模块不等于整包取得软件资格。"
msgstr "The diagram shows current build-time inputs and artifact flow, not runtime calls. Schema-2 TOML, read-only SoC/Board facts, immutable typed IR, atomic bundles and the sole CMake target graph remain. The production default consists of declarative packages, generic DataProvider, DomainPolicies, private `constants` and bounded StaticRecipe. The old F4 family Python constructor modules have been removed, with no family import registry retained. Facts and static connections resolve from one snapshot; the [porting guide](../guides/provider-porting.md) owns the protocol. Field authority, individual modes and consumers still require this batch's integrated acceptance; deleting old modules does not qualify the whole package."

msgid "当前装配链路为：包与事实、Board 和 assembly → 通用解析与资源决策 → 类型化 IR → 静态 C 与选择结果 → 包内 CMake → 编译链接 → SDK 与外部消费者。箭头表示构建期 数据或产物依赖；各模式和消费者的资格以任务退出条件和本批实际回归为准。"
msgstr "The current assembly chain is: package facts, Board and assembly → generic resolution and resource decisions → typed IR → static C and selections → package CMake → compilation and linking → SDK and external consumers. Arrows mean build-time data or artifact dependencies. Each mode and consumer qualifies through its task exit conditions and actual regressions for this batch."

