msgstr "Board data"

msgid "晶振、电源、接线、外部器件与安全电平"
msgstr "Oscillators, power, wiring, external devices and safe levels"

msgid "产品 assembly"
msgstr "Product assembly"

msgid "所选接口、模式、容量、预算与连接"
msgstr "Selected interfaces, modes, capacities, budgets and connections"

msgid "通用配置引擎"
msgstr "Generic configuration engine"

msgid "schema、引用、通用领域语义、资源冲突、确定性选择与诊断"
msgstr "Schemas, references, common domain semantics, resource conflicts, deterministic selection and diagnostics"

msgid "C provider"
msgstr "C provider"

msgid "admission、硬件顺序、等待、回读、错误、停止和恢复"
msgstr "Admission, hardware ordering, waiting, readback, errors, stop and recovery"

msgid "CMake"
msgstr "CMake"

msgid "翻译单元、编译选项、链接目标与实际依赖"
msgstr "Translation units, compile options, link targets and actual dependencies"

msgid "包导出声明"
msgstr "Package export declaration"

msgid "生产导出范围和必要资料，不复制源码编译图"
msgstr "Production export scope and required documentation, without copying the compilation graph"

msgid "执行记录"
msgstr "Execution record"

msgid "实际源码、配置、工具、命令与结果"
msgstr "Actual source, configuration, tools, commands and results"

msgid "同 IP 新料号或路线应只扩展数据与差异验证；新 MCU 的启动、时钟、内存集成仍由 其包维护。新 IP 沿用现有公共语义时新增 C 实现和 binding；真正新增公共语义时才 扩展公共合同。通用引擎不应增加 STM32、F479 或寄存器编码分支。"
msgstr "A new part or route using the same IP should extend only data and distinguishing verification; its package still owns startup, clock and memory integration for a new MCU. New IP with existing public semantics adds a C implementation and binding; genuinely new public semantics extend the public contract. The generic engine should not gain STM32, F479 or register-encoding branches."

msgid "公共领域 IR 表达单位、格式、预算、借用和能力；私有 binding 值必须受 schema 约束且不可变。有限静态表示只生成对象、常量、数组、引用、face、factory、固定 调用和薄 IRQ 连接。C 编译器验证真实私有类型与布局；工具不模拟 ABI，不执行 寄存器脚本，不重新解析已生成的 C 文本。"
msgstr "Public domain IR expresses units, formats, budgets, borrowing and capabilities; private binding values must be immutable and schema-constrained. The bounded static representation emits only objects, constants, arrays, references, faces, factory, fixed calls and thin IRQ connections. The C compiler checks real private types and layouts. The tool does not simulate ABI, execute register scripts or reparse generated C text."

msgid "目录调整服务于责任：当前 F4 私有实现继续就近复用；有真实跨家族共享证据后再提取。 精确型号和封装作为数据。SoC／Board 不放 Python 插件，通用主机工具集中维护。 厂商 gitlink、锁和许可证全部保留，未选库存不进入准备、编译与默认 SDK。"
msgstr "Directory changes follow responsibility. Current private F4 implementation remains locally shared; extraction follows real cross-family sharing evidence. Exact models and packages are data. SoC/Board contain no Python plugins, and generic host tools remain centralized. All vendor gitlinks, locks and licenses remain retained; unselected inventory stays outside preparation, compilation and the default SDK."

msgid "接入包目录责任"
msgstr "Integration package directory responsibilities"

msgid "以下是目标维护边界，不要求为目录外观移动所有文件。事实可以保留原位；同 IP 行为就近共享。包的 binding 与私有 C 类型一同维护，公共工具不复制私有布局。 家族专属构建靠近 SoC，公开通用合同仍由 Core／Arch／I/O 拥有。"
msgstr "These are target maintenance boundaries, not a requirement to move every file for appearance. Facts may remain in place; behavior for the same IP is shared locally. Package bindings are maintained beside private C types rather than copying private layouts into public tools. Family-specific build logic stays near the SoC; Core/Arch/I/O retain public common contracts."

msgid "新增同 IP 器件不改变公共工具、通用 CMake 或 SDK exporter；改变公共操作语义才 演进领域合同。当前版本和 schema 由 [兼容性事实](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/dependencies/platform-compatibility.json)唯一维护，文档不建立 另一份版本策略。过渡路径只在对应模式迁移并验证后删除。"
msgstr "Adding a device with the same IP does not change public tools, common CMake or the SDK exporter. Public operation semantics drive domain-contract evolution. [Compatibility facts](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/dependencies/platform-compatibility.json) uniquely own current versions and schemas; documentation does not establish another version policy. Delete a transition path only after its corresponding modes have migrated and passed verification."

msgid "生命周期、失败与性能边界"
msgstr "Lifecycle, failure and performance boundaries"

msgid "Reset 和必要 pre-C 初始化先满足启动存储条件；永久 SRAM、已启 watchdog 和保留 RTC 不伪装为普通可逆资源。运行期先完成 controller 准入，再建立 System、共享 资源和控制器。具体 owner 保有收条，失败按逆序撤回，首次拒绝释放时保留剩余责任。 primary、cleanup 和 remaining effects 分别报告。"
msgstr "Reset and necessary pre-C initialization first establish startup storage. Permanent SRAM, active watchdogs and retained RTC are not treated as ordinary reversible resources. Runtime controller admission precedes System, shared-resource and controller acquisition. Concrete owners retain receipts. Failure withdraws in reverse order and preserves remaining responsibility at the first refused release. Primary, cleanup and remaining effects are reported separately."

msgid "默认 Platform 协调器与可选 `nx_lifecycle_*` 资源事务职责不同，不要求全部驱动 接入同一组 ops。固定连接和公共入口使用同一手写 C 协调算法，产品启动 scheduler。"
msgstr "The default Platform coordinator and optional `nx_lifecycle_*` resource transactions have different responsibilities; drivers need not all adopt the same ops. Fixed connections and public entry points use one handwritten C coordination algorithm. The product starts the scheduler."

msgid "ACCEPTED 后请求和缓冲借用持续到 acquire 观察 SETTLED。DMA 完成、线上完成、 外设停止和 IRQ／队列引用撤回分别证明；SETTLED 是 provider 的最后一次请求访问。 timeout 或 cancel 不撤销借用；排空失败保留 QUARANTINED 存储。控制、observer、 wake publisher 和任务仍需对应 join。合同见[所有权](../explanation/ownership.md)。"
msgstr "After ACCEPTED, request and buffer borrowing continues until acquire-observed SETTLED. DMA completion, wire completion, peripheral stop and withdrawal of IRQ/queue references are proved separately. SETTLED is the provider's final request access. Timeout or cancellation does not revoke borrowing; failed drain retains QUARANTINED storage. Controls, observers, wake publishers and tasks still need their corresponding join. See [ownership](../explanation/ownership.md)."

msgid "停机先关闭准入并保留执行能力完成排空，再 join 用户和逆序停止资源。暂停失败停在 SUSPENDING；只有完整 SUSPENDED 才能恢复原 plan。STOP 与时钟变化建立新的时间域， 应用和 OS 显式重建 deadline，不能自动复播旧请求。详见 [System](../design/f407-system-power.md)与[时钟屏障](../design/clock-domain-sleep.md)。"
msgstr "Shutdown first closes admission while retaining execution capacity for drain, then joins users and stops resources in reverse order. Failed suspension remains SUSPENDING; only complete SUSPENDED can restore the original plan. STOP and clock changes establish a new time domain. Applications and OS explicitly rebuild deadlines rather than replaying old requests. See [System](../design/f407-system-power.md) and the [clock barrier](../design/clock-domain-sleep.md)."

msgid "HAL／LL 优先用于满足完整模式合同的硬件路径。直接访问限于明确 SDK 缺口、勘误、 原子合同或已证明预算；同一行为域不并存两个 transport owner。config、runtime、 receipt 和共享只读 ops 按真实需求分开，未选模式不分配对应最大状态和缓冲。 性能与空间用实际 ELF、对象、反汇编及测量判断，不能由 inline 或接口形式推定最优。"
msgstr "Prefer HAL/LL for hardware paths satisfying the complete mode contract. Direct access requires an explicit SDK gap, erratum, atomic contract or demonstrated budget; one behavior domain must not have two transport owners. Config, runtime, receipts and shared read-only ops are separated by actual need. Unselected modes allocate neither maximum state nor buffers. Actual ELF, objects, disassembly and measurements determine performance and space, not inline spelling or interface form."

msgid "QuadSPI 当前是精确 W25Q128JV 集成。[独立协议事实](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/private/w25q128jv.h) 与其 C 实现已提纯 JEDEC 身份、adopt、保护状态、页边界、几何与命令，不依赖 控制器 SDK。STATUS → WREN → WEL → PULSE → WIP → VERIFY／WRDI 仍由该精确 集成状态机推进；间接与映射共享一个 owner，保留 WIP、排空和失败责任。当前没有 第二种 NOR 消费者，不为其预建虚表，也不声明任意可替换 NOR backend 已全部解耦。"
msgstr "QuadSPI currently integrates the exact W25Q128JV. The [independent protocol facts](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/soc/stm32/stm32f4/private/w25q128jv.h) and their C implementation isolate JEDEC identity, adoption, protection status, page boundaries, geometry and commands without controller SDK dependencies. The exact integration state machine still advances STATUS → WREN → WEL → PULSE → WIP → VERIFY/WRDI. Indirect and mapped access share one owner, retaining WIP, drain and failure responsibilities. There is no second NOR consumer today; no speculative vtable is added, and arbitrary interchangeable NOR backends are not claimed to be fully decoupled."

msgid "本轮重构退出范围"
msgstr "Exit scope for this refactoring"

msgid "本批要求所有当前承诺模式沿同一装配链迁移，保持公共合同、支持边界和消费者行为。 新增候选模式必须单独实现和验证，不能由头文件、接口或家族目录推定完成。 原有 WP01–WP12、IO01–IO20、R0–R13 与执行结果保留在 [固定基线架构页](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/ba13686b91c94d19ef11acf910653ee2fcc9aa8b/docs/delivery/architecture.md)。 前序 [PR #62](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/62) 和 [PR #63](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/63) 各保留原源码与执行身份；旧计数 不重标为新提交的执行。物理 HIL 与远端 Actions 按用户要求暂缓，本地软件门禁仍必需。"
msgstr "This batch migrates every currently promised mode through the same assembly chain while preserving public contracts, support boundaries and consumer behavior. New candidate modes require separate implementation and verification; headers, interfaces or family directories do not establish completion. The original WP01–WP12, IO01–IO20, R0–R13 and results remain in the [fixed baseline architecture page](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/ba13686b91c94d19ef11acf910653ee2fcc9aa8b/docs/delivery/architecture.md). Earlier [PR #62](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/62) and [PR #63](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/pull/63) retain their actual source and execution identities; old counts are not relabeled as execution of a new commit. Physical HIL and hosted Actions remain deferred by user request; local software gates remain required."

msgid "本轮架构迭代任务"
msgstr "Current architecture iteration tasks"

msgid "以下 60 项是本页人工审查表，不是新的配置源、台账引擎或资格流程。状态区分 合同已固定、实施中、已有实现但待集成验证与已验证。只有对应实现、消费者与实际 执行齐全才关闭任务；已有实现不表示当前完整矩阵、SDK 或软件候选通过。A–E 固定 纵向链路，F 迁移现有模式，G／H 验证并清除过渡路径。第二家族的软件切片单独验收，不自动扩大生产支持。"
msgstr "These 60 items form this page's manual review table, not another configuration source, ledger engine or qualification process. Status distinguishes fixed contracts, implementation in progress, implemented but awaiting integrated validation, and validated work. A task closes only with its implementation, consumers and actual execution complete. Existing implementation does not mean the current full matrix, SDK or software candidate has passed. A–E establish the vertical chain, F migrates current modes, and G/H validate and remove transition paths. The second-family software slice has separate acceptance and does not automatically expand production support."

msgid "A：架构合同"
msgstr "A: architecture contracts"

msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

msgid "任务与退出条件"
msgstr "Task and exit condition"

msgid "状态"
msgstr "Status"

msgid "A01"
msgstr "A01"

msgid "固定层依赖 DAG；公共层无反向依赖，SDK 私有"
msgstr "Fix the layer dependency DAG; no reverse dependencies in public layers; SDK remains private"

msgid "合同已固定，待集成验证"
msgstr "Contract fixed; integrated validation pending"

msgid "A02"
msgstr "A02"

msgid "固定 controller／face／endpoint／signal／request 和 owner 模型"
msgstr "Fix controller/face/endpoint/signal/request and owner models"

msgid "A03"
msgstr "A03"

msgid "固定事实权威；每个字段只有一个作者来源"
msgstr "Fix fact authority; each field has one authored source"

msgid "pad 单一权威已落；其余字段核对中"
msgstr "Single pad authority implemented; other fields under review"

msgid "A04"
msgstr "A04"

msgid "区分 assembly、包、binding、IR 与接口兼容协议"
msgstr "Separate assembly, package, binding, IR and interface compatibility protocols"

msgid "协议已有实现，待集成验证"
msgstr "Protocol implemented; integrated validation pending"

msgid "A05"
msgstr "A05"

msgid "固定迁移基线、支持范围和结果身份，不继承旧资格"
msgstr "Fix migration baseline, support scope and result identity without inherited qualification"

msgid "基线已固定"
msgstr "Baseline fixed"

msgid "B：硬件事实与包协议"
msgstr "B: hardware facts and package protocol"

msgid "B01"
msgstr "B01"

msgid "统一内外置 package 协议与入口、版本、重复 ID 检查"
msgstr "Unify internal/external package protocol, entries, versions and duplicate-ID checks"

msgid "已有实现，待集成验证"
msgstr "Implemented; integrated validation pending"

msgid "B02"
msgstr "B02"

msgid "统一器件与 IP catalog，移除重复 PARTS 与型号白名单"
msgstr "Unify device and IP catalogs; remove duplicate PARTS and model allowlists"

msgid "B03"
msgstr "B03"

msgid "统一 pin／AF／route 数据，不从路线名称推断能力"
msgstr "Unify pin/AF/route data without inferring capability from route names"

msgid "显式 pad／route 已落，接线一致性收尾中"
msgstr "Explicit pads/routes implemented; wiring consistency being finalized"

msgid "B04"
msgstr "B04"

msgid "统一 DMA／IRQ／trigger 与共享资源，冲突和 owner 可解释"
msgstr "Unify DMA/IRQ/triggers and shared resources; explain conflicts and owners"

msgid "已有资源模型，待完整冲突与共享验证"
msgstr "Resource model implemented; complete conflict/shared-resource validation pending"

msgid "B05"
msgstr "B05"

msgid "统一 clock／memory 事实，明确 DMA 可达性和内存属性"
msgstr "Unify clock/memory facts with explicit DMA reachability and memory attributes"

msgid "已有显式事实，待内存／时钟集成验证"
msgstr "Explicit facts implemented; integrated memory/clock validation pending"

msgid "B06"
msgstr "B06"

msgid "Board 电气连接与 signal 统一，极性和安全电平分开"
msgstr "Unify Board electrical wiring and signals; keep polarity separate from safe levels"

msgid "已有 signal 与电气连接，待集成验证"
msgstr "Signals and electrical connections implemented; integrated validation pending"

msgid "B07"
msgstr "B07"

msgid "关联资料、勘误和模式，分开硬件、软件与执行状态"
msgstr "Associate references, errata and modes; distinguish hardware, software and execution status"

msgid "资料事实已有实现，待独立范围核对"
msgstr "Reference facts implemented; independent scope review pending"

msgid "C：配置与静态实例"
msgstr "C: configuration and static instances"

msgid "C01"
msgstr "C01"

msgid "通用包加载替代家族 Python 注册，新家族不修改公共注册表"
msgstr "Replace family Python registration with generic package loading; new families do not edit a public registry"

msgid "已有实现，待完整装配验证"
msgstr "Implemented; complete assembly validation pending"

msgid "C02"
msgstr "C02"

msgid "公共与私有 binding schema 严格校验，不穿透任意字典"
msgstr "Strictly validate public and private binding schemas without arbitrary dictionaries passing through"

msgid "C03"
msgstr "C03"

msgid "收敛不可变 typed IR，引用、单位、模式与私有记录明确"
msgstr "Converge immutable typed IR with explicit references, units, modes and private records"

msgid "C04"
msgstr "C04"

msgid "清除公共 resolver 的家族分支，限制移入事实或私有 C"
msgstr "Remove family branches from the public resolver; put constraints in facts or private C"

msgid "公共策略剩余耦合清理中"
msgstr "Remaining coupling in common policies being removed"

msgid "C05"
msgstr "C05"

msgid "有限静态初始化替代任意 Construction C 字符串"
msgstr "Replace arbitrary Construction C strings with bounded static initialization"

msgid "生产路径已迁移，待完整生成与编译验证"
msgstr "Production path migrated; complete generation and compilation validation pending"

msgid "C06"
msgstr "C06"

msgid "显式 IRQ 与屏障连接，删除正则改写生成 C"
msgstr "Make IRQ/barrier connections explicit; remove regex rewriting of generated C"

msgid "已有实现，待生成 IRQ 编译与模型验证"
msgstr "Implemented; generated IRQ compilation and model validation pending"

msgid "C07"
msgstr "C07"

msgid "默认 strong factory，跨类别 ID 误传在编译阶段失败"
msgstr "Default to strong factory; reject cross-category IDs at compile time"

msgid "待集成验证"
msgstr "Integration verification pending"

msgid "C08"
msgstr "C08"

msgid "确定性原子 bundle；失败不消费旧输出"
msgstr "Deterministic atomic bundles; failure never consumes stale output"

msgid "D：C 实现与运行连接"
msgstr "D: C implementation and runtime connections"

msgid "D01"
msgstr "D01"

msgid "按模式整理 config／runtime／receipt，无最大状态并集或重复收条"
msgstr "Separate config/runtime/receipt by mode without maximum-state unions or duplicate receipts"

msgid "已有模式拆分，待本批成本与状态审查"
msgstr "Mode-specific layouts implemented; costs and state review for this batch pending"

msgid "D02"
msgstr "D02"

msgid "HAL／LL／私有访问边界明确，同一行为域唯一 owner"
msgstr "Explicit HAL/LL/private-access boundaries; one owner per behavior domain"

msgid "D03"
msgstr "D03"

msgid "启动、时钟与 pre-C 依赖清晰，时间基准显式"
msgstr "Clear startup, clock and pre-C dependencies with an explicit timebase"

msgid "D04"
msgstr "D04"

msgid "停止、回滚与恢复保留真实残效，失败不假结清"
msgstr "Stop, rollback and recovery retain actual effects; failure never claims false settlement"

msgid "D05"
msgstr "D05"

msgid "保持 Core／Arch／OS 等待、屏蔽、时间域和内核边界"
msgstr "Preserve Core/Arch/OS wait, mask, time-domain and kernel boundaries"

msgid "D06"
msgstr "D06"

msgid "signal、endpoint、bus owner 由装配统一连接"
msgstr "Assembly connects signals, endpoints and bus owners consistently"

msgid "固定连接与 signal 已落，待完整消费者验证"
msgstr "Fixed connections and signals implemented; complete consumer validation pending"

msgid "E：构建、依赖与 SDK"
msgstr "E: build, dependencies and SDK"

msgid "E01"
msgstr "E01"

msgid "通用 CMake 桥，不再逐项传播私有 feature 变量"
msgstr "Generic CMake bridge without per-feature propagation of private variables"

msgid "E02"
msgstr "E02"

msgid "家族 CMake 归入 SoC 包，公共层无 F4 编译细节"
msgstr "Move family CMake into the SoC package; no F4 compile details in common layers"

msgid "E03"
msgstr "E03"

msgid "SDK 宏、ABI、startup、linker 保持正确作用域"
msgstr "Keep correct scope for SDK macros, ABI, startup and linker"

msgid "E04"
msgstr "E04"

msgid "SDK 按包导出范围收集，新驱动不改公共逐文件清单"
msgstr "Collect SDK by package export scope; new drivers do not edit common per-file lists"

msgid "E05"
msgstr "E05"

msgid "canonical consumer 与 fake fixture 收敛，helper 不重复维护白名单"
msgstr "Converge canonical consumers and fake fixtures; no duplicate helper allowlists"

msgid "E06"
msgstr "E06"

msgid "源码与 SDK 共用工程路径，公开用户可独立配置、编译和使用"
msgstr "Source and SDK share the project workflow; public users can configure, build and consume independently"

msgid "E07"
msgstr "E07"

msgid "包依赖进入现有来源与锁，未选库存不准备或默认导出"
msgstr "Package dependencies use existing provenance and locks; unselected inventory is neither prepared nor exported by default"

msgid "按包选依赖已有实现，待完整 SDK 验证"
msgstr "Package-selected dependencies implemented; complete SDK validation pending"

msgid "F：全部现有外设模式迁移"
msgstr "F: migration of all existing peripheral modes"

msgid "F01"
msgstr "F01"

msgid "GPIO／EXTI：授权 view、signal、共享 IRQ 一致"
msgstr "GPIO/EXTI: consistent authorized views, signals and shared IRQs"

msgid "F02"
msgstr "F02"

msgid "UART／RS485：pin／DMA 路线数据化，DE 复用 signal"
msgstr "UART/RS485: data-driven pin/DMA routes; DE reuses a signal"

msgid "数据绑定与 DE signal 已落，待完整回归"
msgstr "Data bindings and DE signal implemented; complete regression pending"

msgid "F03"
msgstr "F03"

msgid "SPI：controller／endpoint／DMA 解耦，尾部与取消正确"
msgstr "SPI: separate controller/endpoint/DMA; preserve tail and cancellation behavior"

msgid "静态连接已迁移，CS／endpoint 收尾中"
msgstr "Static connections migrated; CS/endpoint integration being finalized"

msgid "F04"
msgstr "F04"

msgid "I2C：消除固定 pin，明确 master／target／恢复边界"
msgstr "I2C: remove fixed pins; define master/target/recovery boundaries"

msgid "已有实现，待完整 master／target 回归"
msgstr "Implemented; complete master/target regression pending"

msgid "F05"
msgstr "F05"

msgid "DMA／TIM／ADC／DAC：资源与触发图一致，单位准确"
msgstr "DMA/TIM/ADC/DAC: consistent resource and trigger graphs with accurate units"

msgid "已有实现，待资源与触发组合验证"
msgstr "Implemented; resource and trigger combination validation pending"

msgid "F06"
msgstr "F06"

msgid "I2S／SAI：slot／clock／DMA 配置化，块所有权保持"
msgstr "I2S/SAI: configurable slots/clocks/DMA; preserve block ownership"

msgid "已有实现，待选定音频模式集成验证"
msgstr "Implemented; integrated validation of selected audio modes pending"

msgid "F07"
msgstr "F07"

msgid "DCMI／LTDC／DMA2D：帧、块、图层、区域与退役语义保持"
msgstr "DCMI/LTDC/DMA2D: preserve frame, block, layer, region and retirement semantics"

msgid "已有实现，待帧／图层模式集成验证"
msgstr "Implemented; integrated frame/layer mode validation pending"

msgid "F08"
msgstr "F08"

msgid "FMC／SDRAM：几何、时序、bank 与时间基准解耦"
msgstr "FMC/SDRAM: separate geometry, timing, bank and timebase"

msgid "几何与时基解耦已落，外存集成收尾中"
msgstr "Geometry and timebase decoupled; external-memory integration being finalized"

msgid "F09"
msgstr "F09"

msgid "Flash／NOR／NAND：控制器、协议、区域和维护分离"
msgstr "Flash/NOR/NAND: separate controller, protocol, region and maintenance"

msgid "已有实现，待本批区域与维护回归"
msgstr "Implemented; region and maintenance regressions for this batch pending"

msgid "F10"
msgstr "F10"

msgid "QuadSPI：精确 NOR 协议事实与物理边界提纯，间接／映射借用由单一 owner 协调"
msgstr "QuadSPI: isolate exact NOR protocol facts and physical boundaries; one owner coordinates indirect/mapped borrows"

msgid "已有实现，待同源码回归"
msgstr "Implemented; regressions on the same source pending"

msgid "F11"
msgstr "F11"

msgid "SDIO：host／card／function／block 分层与 DMA 路线一致"
msgstr "SDIO: consistent host/card/function/block layers and DMA routes"

msgid "分层与所选 DMA 路线已落，待完整回归"
msgstr "Layering and selected DMA routes implemented; complete regression pending"

msgid "F12"
msgstr "F12"

msgid "CAN／Ethernet：共享资源、PHY、内存和 descriptor 归属明确"
msgstr "CAN/Ethernet: clear ownership of shared resources, PHY, memory and descriptors"

msgid "已有实现，共享资源与投影收尾中"
msgstr "Implemented; shared-resource and projection integration being finalized"

msgid "F13"
msgstr "F13"

msgid "USB：底层与中间件唯一 owner，角色与供电显式"
msgstr "USB: one lower-layer/middleware owner; explicit roles and power"

msgid "已有实现，factory／角色连接收尾中"
msgstr "Implemented; factory/role connections being finalized"

msgid "F14"
msgstr "F14"

msgid "RTC／监督／电源／芯片服务／密码外设：保留域、不可逆操作与敏感状态明确"
msgstr "RTC/supervision/power/chip services/crypto peripherals: explicit retained domains, irreversible operations and sensitive state"

msgid "G：测试与成本"
msgstr "G: testing and cost"

msgid "G01"
msgstr "G01"

msgid "按独立合同精简测试，每个删除项有失效或等价覆盖依据"
msgstr "Retain tests by independent contract; justify every deletion by obsolescence or equivalent coverage"

msgid "主要合同已迁移，待完整保留集回归"
msgstr "Main contracts migrated; complete retained-suite regression pending"

msgid "G02"
msgstr "G02"

msgid "新行为记录真实 RED／GREEN，对应实际源码与失败"
msgstr "Record genuine RED/GREEN for new behavior against actual source and failure"

msgid "已记录所改行为 RED／GREEN，待最终证据核对"
msgstr "Changed behavior has RED/GREEN records; final evidence review pending"

msgid "G03"
msgstr "G03"

msgid "未知字段、失效引用、冲突与非法模式负例明确拒绝"
msgstr "Explicitly reject negative cases for unknown fields, broken references, conflicts and illegal modes"

msgid "G04"
msgstr "G04"

msgid "生产 C 覆盖 IRQ、迟到事件、取消与失败排空"
msgstr "Exercise production C for IRQ, late events, cancellation and failed drain"

msgid "G05"
msgstr "G05"

msgid "ARM 矩阵验证器件差异、startup、ABI、内存和符号"
msgstr "ARM matrix checks device differences, startup, ABI, memory and symbols"

msgid "G06"
msgstr "G06"

msgid "实测所选镜像 Flash／RAM，解释同步、异步与连续成本"
msgstr "Measure selected-image Flash/RAM and explain synchronous, asynchronous and continuous costs"

msgid "G07"
msgstr "G07"

msgid "源码／SDK 双消费、重定位、恢复、身份和边界一致"
msgstr "Consistent source/SDK consumption, relocation, recovery, identity and boundaries"

msgid "H：工程与交付"
msgstr "H: engineering and delivery"

msgid "H01"
msgstr "H01"

msgid "托管入口统一目录锁，同目录受控、不同目录并行、嵌套无死锁"
msgstr "Unify managed-entry directory locks: same-directory exclusion, separate-directory parallelism, no nested deadlock"

msgid "H02"
msgstr "H02"

msgid "门禁选域覆盖删除、重命名、未知影响与公共政策变化"
msgstr "Gate domain selection covers deletions, renames, unknown impacts and common policy changes"

msgid "H03"
msgstr "H03"

msgid "当前文档与教程分清历史身份，中英文一致"
msgstr "Current documentation and tutorials distinguish historical identity; Chinese and English agree"

msgid "当前协议与双语更新中，待独立审查与严格构建"
msgstr "Current protocols and bilingual prose being updated; independent review and strict build pending"

msgid "H04"
msgstr "H04"

msgid "依赖升级沿组织 fork、gitlink、许可和受影响验证执行"
msgstr "Dependency upgrades follow organization forks, gitlinks, licenses and affected verification"

msgid "H05"
msgstr "H05"

msgid "实际第二家族 SDK 纵向切片验证接口与接入修改面"
msgstr "A real second-family SDK vertical slice verifies interfaces and integration change surface"

msgid "第二家族参考链已有实现，待最终集成验证"
msgstr "Second-family reference chain implemented; final integrated validation pending"

msgid "H06"
msgstr "H06"

msgid "删除过渡路径，源码、SDK、支持范围与实际结果一致"
msgstr "Remove transition paths; source, SDK, support scope and actual results agree"

msgid "旧家族构造已删除，剩余过渡与声明核对中"
msgstr "Old family constructors removed; remaining transitions and declarations under review"

msgid "验证与阅读入口"
msgstr "Verification and reading entries"

msgid "[接入指南](../guides/provider-porting.md)区分新 Board、路线、料号、IP 与公共语义。 [工程手册](../design/engineering-handbook.md)维护 TDD、风格、测试保留与普通提交门禁； [SDK 教程](../tutorials/source-sdk.md)维护公开消费入口。硬件事实、模型行为、ARM 链接、SDK 消费和物理 HIL 分别验收。当前物理执行仍为 `not_executed`，见 [资格边界](qualification.md)。"
msgstr "The [porting guide](../guides/provider-porting.md) distinguishes a new Board, route, part, IP and public semantics. The [engineering handbook](../design/engineering-handbook.md) owns TDD, style, test retention and ordinary commit gates. The [SDK tutorial](../tutorials/source-sdk.md) owns public consumption. Hardware facts, model behavior, ARM linking, SDK consumption and physical HIL are accepted separately. Physical execution remains `not_executed`; see [qualification boundaries](qualification.md)."
